1
00:00:00,092 --> 00:00:03,332
(Sheldon:)I suggest you look
for long-lost relatives

2
00:00:03,495 --> 00:00:06,105
(Sheldon:)either in Armenia or Lebanon.

3
00:00:08,233 --> 00:00:09,773
(Leonard:)Listen to me, Sheldon.

4
00:00:09,935 --> 00:00:11,845
(Leonard:)I am not going to Lebanon

5
00:00:12,004 --> 00:00:15,614
(Leonard:)to return
Super Mario Bros. the movie!

6
00:00:17,276 --> 00:00:20,746
Anyway, it might be fun.
You love hummus.

7
00:00:22,681 --> 00:00:24,521
(Leonard:)Why isn't this bothering you?

8
00:00:24,683 --> 00:00:26,683
(Leonard:)Isn't your brain getting itchy?

9
00:00:26,852 --> 00:00:29,132
(Leonard:)This is on your card.

10
00:00:29,288 --> 00:00:31,398
(Leonard:)This could be ruining
your credit score!

11
00:00:31,557 --> 00:00:34,467
(Leonard:)Why isn't this making you crazy?

12
00:00:36,361 --> 00:00:37,571
(Sheldon:)Leonard...

13
00:00:39,298 --> 00:00:41,298
(Sheldon:)I have something to tell you,

14
00:00:41,466 --> 00:00:44,306
(Sheldon:)but I want you to promise
not to flip out.

15
00:00:44,469 --> 00:00:45,639
(Leonard:)What?

16
00:00:47,639 --> 00:00:49,089
(Sheldon:)Seven years ago,

17
00:00:49,241 --> 00:01:00,021
(Sheldon:)I found out the DVD was late
and I paid for it.

